---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BrandMark from '../../components/BrandMark.astro';
import GuidedEstimate from '../../components/GuidedEstimate.astro';
import RecentWork from '../../components/RecentWork.astro';
import ServiceGrid from '../../components/ServiceGrid.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
import assets from '../../data/demo-assets.json';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Future Concept | ${site.name}`} description="Modern East Coast Foam website and digital operations concept." theme="future">
  <div id="top" class="future-site">
    <header class="future-nav-wrap">
      <nav class="future-nav" aria-label="Future navigation">
        <BrandMark />
        <div class="future-nav__links"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#work">Recent Work</a><a href="#process">How it works</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div>
        <a class="future-nav__cta" href="#estimate">Request an estimate</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="future-hero">
        <div class="future-hero__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Beaufort born · Lowcountry focused</p>
          <h1>Comfort built to last.<br /><em>Foam done right.</em></h1>
          <p class="future-lede">A modern East Coast Foam presence centered on clear choices, real project work, fast estimate intake, and an owner customers can actually reach.</p>
          <div class="future-actions"><a class="future-button" href="#estimate">Start an estimate</a><a class="future-call" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>Call {site.phoneDisplay}</a></div>
          <div class="trust-row"><span>Locally owned</span><span>Lowcountry service area</span><span>Clear estimate conversation</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="future-hero__visual" aria-label="East Coast Foam work photography concept">
          <img class="future-hero__primary-photo" src={assets.hero} alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
          <div class="foam-orbit foam-orbit--one"></div><div class="foam-orbit foam-orbit--two"></div>
          <div class="future-photo-stack" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src={assets.serviceImages['closed-cell-spray-foam-insulation']} alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
            <img src={assets.serviceImages['spray-foam-roofing']} alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
          </div>
          <div class="future-photo-card"><span>Recent work first</span><strong>Make Casey's actual jobs the visual identity.</strong><small>Current-site media is being used temporarily for this private concept.</small></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="future-proofbar" aria-label="Future customer experience priorities">
        <div><strong>One owner to reach</strong><span>Keep the personal small-business experience visible.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Professional domain identity</strong><span>{site.publicEmail} on the site from day one.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Real project storytelling</strong><span>Turn completed work into reusable website and social proof.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Fast on every device</strong><span>Static-first Cloudflare delivery with minimal moving parts.</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="future-section" id="services">
        <div class="section-heading-row"><div><div class="section-kicker">What we do</div><h2>The right insulation system starts with the right conversation.</h2></div><p>Clear service explanations replace keyword-heavy copy while preserving the search intent and service coverage needed for migration.</p></div>
        <ServiceGrid />
      </section>

      <section class="future-section future-compare" aria-label="Open-cell and closed-cell comparison concept">
        <div class="future-compare__intro">
          <div class="section-kicker">Help customers choose</div>
          <h2>Open cell or closed cell?</h2>
          <p>The new site should answer the first obvious question without pretending every building has the same answer. Customers learn the difference, then Casey confirms what fits the project.</p>
          <a class="future-button" href="#estimate">Tell us about the space</a>
        </div>
        <div class="future-compare__cards">
          <article class="foam-choice">
            <img src={assets.serviceImages['open-cell-spray-foam-insulation']} alt="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
            <div class="foam-choice__body"><span>Option 01</span><h3>Open-cell spray foam</h3><p>A flexible air-sealing option often considered for conditioned attics, rooflines, walls, and other assemblies where its characteristics fit the design.</p><a href="#estimate">Ask if open cell fits →</a></div>
          </article>
          <article class="foam-choice">
            <img src={assets.serviceImages['closed-cell-spray-foam-insulation']} alt="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
            <div class="foam-choice__body"><span>Option 02</span><h3>Closed-cell spray foam</h3><p>A denser system with strong thermal performance and moisture resistance, useful when the assembly and project goals call for those properties.</p><a href="#estimate">Ask if closed cell fits →</a></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="future-band">
        <div><span class="big-number">01</span><p>Tell us about the space.</p></div><div><span class="big-number">02</span><p>East Coast Foam assesses the right approach.</p></div><div><span class="big-number">03</span><p>You get a clear estimate and next step.</p></div>
      </section>

      <div class="future-section"><GuidedEstimate /></div>
      <div class="future-section"><RecentWork /></div>

      <section class="future-schedule" aria-label="Consultation scheduling concept">
        <div><div class="section-kicker">Optional self-scheduling</div><h2>Let customers book the conversation—not the crew.</h2><p>A future free consultation/site-visit scheduler could respect Casey's calendar and travel windows while keeping actual installation scheduling under his control.</p></div>
        <div class="future-schedule__action"><strong>Free consultation / site visit</strong><span>Future Cal.com or other validated scheduler integration. Installation dates stay owner-managed.</span><a class="future-button" href="#contact">Scheduling concept</a></div>
      </section>

      <section class="future-section process-section" id="process">
        <div class="section-kicker">And it can grow with the business</div>
        <h2>The website becomes a better front door—not another system Casey has to babysit.</h2>
        <div class="process-grid">
          <article><span>Now</span><h3>Website + professional identity</h3><p>Fast hosting, domain email presentation, easy content editing, quote intake, analytics, monitoring, and customer-owned infrastructure.</p></article>
          <article><span>Next</span><h3>Reuse the work Casey already does</h3><p>Facebook project-photo import, Recent Work publishing, better review requests, and lead-source visibility without double entry.</p></article>
          <article><span>Only if useful</span><h3>Owner operations view</h3><p>QuickBooks-aware lead status, accepted-job scheduling, crew/truck visibility, completion follow-up, and exceptions that need Casey's attention.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="future-contact" id="contact">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Let's talk about the project</p><h2>One owner. One number. A much better digital front door.</h2></div>
        <div class="future-contact__links"><a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a><a href={`mailto:${site.publicEmail}`}>{site.publicEmail}</a><a href={`mailto:${site.quoteEmail}`}>{site.quoteEmail}</a><span>{site.address}</span></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="future-footer"><BrandMark compact /><p>Future concept by Lowcountry Digital Works · current-site media is temporary pending owner approval.</p></footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
